        <item>
            <title>0.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:37:06 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in SwapMac 0.2.1</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Quieter in the background:</b> with its window closed, SwapMac now uses no CPU at all. Live numbers refresh only while you can see them, and more slowly on battery and in Low Power Mode.</li>
<li><b>Activity:</b> a new screen listing cleanups, uninstalls, put-backs, items about to leave the Trash, and updates, each with one thing you can do about it.</li>
<li><b>Settings → Monitoring:</b> turn live numbers off, choose how often they refresh, see what SwapMac itself uses, and choose notifications. They're off unless you turn them on, and never about buying anything.</li>
<li><b>Optional low-space alert</b> when free space drops below 10 GB, at most once a day.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
